+            f"the fp8_dsv4_mla and fp8_g64 caches and the SWA+top-k two-loop are "
+            f"{'/'.join(PACKED_ARCHS)}-only and have no implementation on {arch}. "
+            f"Use the flat {flat} cache there."
+        )
