+"""DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash mono decode layer: one decoder layer of a decode step in
+two persistent FlyDSL launches, its TP all-reduces in-kernel (README.md). The
+host side is ``runner``; vLLM docks it in ``..mono_decode``."""
